[
  {
    "beat_id": 1,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "此卦……",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "肚脐上那朵白花——开到了第七朵。\n血是粉红色的，从左眼角往下淌。陆九的右眼已经看不清龟壳上的裂纹了，但他的手指能摸出来——第七条裂纹，从龟甲正中央劈开，一路劈到"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "左眼已经瞎了二十三年。右眼今天早上才裂——他用右眼看了太多不该看的东西。命格反噬从肚脐往外长，每开一朵白花，他的命就少一年。这是第七朵。他数过。龟壳告诉他数的。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你这一卦——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "不是老道的话。\n是陆九自己肚脐上传来的声音。像是湿纸被撕开，又像是骨节错位。那朵白花从肉里钻出来的时候带着一股温热——\n不冷。\n陆九的左手按住了自己的小腹。掌心"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "——你自己算吧。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "老道终于把话说完了。\n\"——你自己算吧。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "算什么？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的右手还按在龟壳上。龟壳的温度不对——太烫了。不是他手心的温度，是龟壳自己在发热。裂纹里那根白色的丝在发热。\n\"算什么？\"陆九问。\n\"算你为什么——还没死。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你听不见。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "老道的声音变了。不再是刚才那种沙哑的、像是嗓子里卡着痰的老人声。是一个年轻女人的声音——\n陆九的左眼流下白色的泪。\n左眼瞎了二十三年，从来没流过泪。今天流了。白"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你每算一卦，",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的手指在龟壳上收紧。龟壳的齿状突起扎进他的指腹，血珠渗出来，滴在白花的花瓣上。花瓣吃掉了那滴血。粉红色的血被花瓣吸干——\n花瓣变成了红的。\n\"你每算一卦，\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你这一卦——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的右眼停了。\n他不看龟壳了。他看老道。老道坐在卦摊对面，八仙桌的另一头，佝偻着背，灰布道袍上打满补丁——但他的手不对。老道的手不该是那个样子。老道的手应该是"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你算到了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "第三次听见这句话了。\n陆九的肚脐上——第八朵白花开了。\n血。粉红的血从花心里涌出来，顺着他的小腹往下淌，浸透了腰间那块补了三回的旧布。布上的血迹变成了一个圆——"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "九哥哥。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的左眼——那只瞎了二十三年的左眼——突然能看见了。\n他看见的不是老道。\n他看见的是师妹。\n师妹坐在他对面。十二岁模样。眉心一颗红痣。穿着他记忆里那件鹅黄色的"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你终于看见我了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "声音很轻。从他左边传来，又像从很远的地方传来。\n\"你终于看见我了。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "等——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的右手松开了龟壳。\n龟壳从桌面上滚下去，落在青石板上——\n没碎。\n但裂纹里那根白色的丝——断了。\n断口处渗出粉红色的血。\n陆九低头去看——师妹的脸不见了。白"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 13,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆九。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他伸手去按自己的肚脐。手指刚碰到花瓣的边缘——\n花瓣合上了。\n八朵白花一起合上。每朵花的花心都鼓起一个小包——像是有什么东西被关在了里面。\n师妹的命格——被他关"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 14,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "三日后——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "老道的声音回来了。还是那个沙哑的、卡着痰的老人声。\n\"三日后——\"老道说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 15,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "三日后你头顶发绿——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九抬头。\n老道的眼睛是瞎的。两个眼眶里塞着两颗黑色的算筹——不是塞着——是从眼眶里长出来的。铁算筹从眼眶里往外伸了半寸，尖端带着锈。\n\"三日后你头顶发绿——\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 16,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "是神女。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的手指还按在自己肚脐上。八朵合上的白花在他掌心里微微发烫。\n\"是神女。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 17,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你这一卦……",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "老道说完这句话——\n他的嘴没有闭上。\n嘴角往上扯。扯到脸颊——左脸颊有一颗酒窝。\n\"你这一卦……\"老道说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 18,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "好久不见。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "木屐点地三下。\n陆九的右眼剧痛。他没看见老道站起来——他看见的是师妹。师妹坐在卦摊对面，十二岁模样，正在对他笑。笑得头歪向一边——\n老道不是老道。\n老道是白无垢"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 19,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你把我师妹的命格——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢说。\n他的右手从袖子里伸出来。\n没有手。\n袖口里是十二根铁算筹。每根算筹的尖端都带着一缕粉红色的血——和陆九肚脐上流出来的血——\n同一种颜色。\n\"你把我师"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 20,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "木屐又点地三下。\n陆九的肚脐上——第九朵白花——\n正在开。"
  }
]